Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.53,Screen,1,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\an7\fn@方正准圆_GBK\an2\bord2\fs65\blur3\3c&H000000&\3a&H38&\pos(1701.6,155.2)}还是进王宫比较稳妥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:06.06,Screen,1,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\an2\bord2\fs65\blur3\pos(960,927)\3c&H000000&\3a&H38&}我是非战斗成员
