Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:35.51,Screen,1,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\an2\bord2\fs65\blur3\pos(960,927)\3c&H000000&\3a&H38&}被打中的话很痛的
